<tr><td align='left' valign='top'>McNary & Associates, LLC</td><td align='left' valign='top'>McNary Group</td><td align='left' valign='top'>Lacey</td><td align='left' valign='top'>McNary</td><td align='left' valign='top'>7222 Fox Harbor Road, n/a</td><td align='left' valign='top'>Louisville</td><td align='center' valign='top'>KY</td><td align='center' valign='top'>&ensp;40059</td><td align='left' valign='top'>7222 Fox Harbor Road, n/a</td><td align='left' valign='top'>Louisville</td><td align='center' valign='top'>KY</td><td align='center' valign='top'>&ensp;40059</td><td align='center' valign='top'>502-419-7335</td><td align='center' valign='top'></td><td align='left' valign='top'>lacey@mcnarygroup.com</td><td align='left' valign='top'>http://mcnarygroup.com</td><td align='center' valign='top'>LouisvilleKY</td><td align='center' valign='top'>WBE</td><td align='center' valign='top'>Caucasian</td><td align='left' valign='top'>Samples of recent work:; •	Developed federal grants.; •	Developed implementation manual.; •	Designed community and board of director surveys.; •	Survey analysis and creation of survey reports. ; •	Secured earned media for several campaigns that included social media, op/eds, and news stories; •	Created op/eds, press packets, media advisories, and press releases. ; •	Assisted with planning advocacy rallies and campaigns.; •	Conducted research and created public policy issue briefs to inform on current topics. ; •	Secured funding and coordinating the creation of a new national tool called the Oral Health Needs Index (OHNI). ; •	Provide advocacy capacity building in order to gain passage of legislation.; •	Provide on-going technical assistance to develop and manage various coalition and assisting in all aspects of the projects from development, design, and ; •	Facilitation of coalitional convening’s and policy prioritization processes.; •	Management of outreach and research to securing funding for sustainability. ; •	Designed, recruited, managed, and facilitated a research advisory committee on oral health access in Kentucky. This included conducting direct outreach to oral health stakeholders; project managed all aspects of the assessment to ensure goals and priories are met; and served as lead manager and facilitator of advisory committee.; •	Conduct a stakeholder analysis; that identified the knowledge gap in order to achieve goals; developed and implemented network engagement strategies to foster greater connectivity and alignment within regions; created a set of messages that communicate vision and goals; and designed regional convening’s that brought together a diverse set of stakeholders.; •	Serving as a subject matter expert to create and deliver webinar and learning materials on Results Based Leadership for network members. ; •	Provided research and policy language for Complete Streets policy for local cities. ; •	Served as a grant reviewer for multiple state and national organizations.</td><td align='left' valign='top'>Services</td><td align='left' valign='top'>541611 - Reorganizational consulting services; 541611 - Strategic planning consulting services; 541611 - Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services; 541618 - Other Management Consulting Services; 541720 - Research and Development in the Social Sciences and Humanities</td></tr>
